{"seq":2,"slug":"rtl-abstraction","title":"RTL 抽象层次","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/foundations/rtl-abstraction","wordCount":1122,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"rtl-抽象层次\">RTL 抽象层次</h1><p>当工程师说「我在写 RTL」时，他们指的是一种非常具体的描述风格：把电路看成一组寄存器，以及寄存器之间在每个时钟周期里如何通过组合逻辑传递数据。RTL 是 Register Transfer Level（寄存器传输级）的缩写，这个名字本身就揭示了它的世界观——电路的行为，就是数据在寄存器之间的传输与变换。今天几乎所有可综合的数字设计都工作在这一层，它是连接「人能理解的算法」与「机器能实现的门」之间的枢纽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RTL 把电路切成两类东西交替排列：存储状态的<strong>寄存器</strong>（在时钟边沿更新），和决定下一个状态、不带记忆的<strong>组合逻辑</strong>（在寄存器之间）。一个时钟周期里发生的事可以浓缩成一句话：当前寄存器的值经过组合逻辑算出新值，在下一个时钟沿被锁进寄存器。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[输入] --&gt; CL1[组合逻辑]&#10;    R0[寄存器 当前状态] --&gt; CL1&#10;    CL1 --&gt; R1[寄存器 下一状态]&#10;    R1 --&gt; CL2[组合逻辑]&#10;    CL2 --&gt; O[输出]&#10;    CLK[时钟] -.驱动边沿.-&gt; R0&#10;    CLK -.驱动边沿.-&gt; R1\">flowchart TD\n    A[输入] --&gt; CL1[组合逻辑]\n    R0[寄存器 当前状态] --&gt; CL1\n    CL1 --&gt; R1[寄存器 下一状态]\n    R1 --&gt; CL2[组合逻辑]\n    CL2 --&gt; O[输出]\n    CLK[时钟] -.驱动边沿.-&gt; R0\n    CLK -.驱动边沿.-&gt; R1</pre><p>RTL 在抽象阶梯上的位置很关键：它比门级高（你不用手画每个门），又比纯行为级低（你必须明确哪些值存在寄存器里、组合逻辑长什么样）。下表把它放在三层抽象里对照。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抽象层次</th>\n<th>你需要明确指定的东西</th>\n<th>你可以交给工具的东西</th>\n<th>可综合性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行为级</td>\n<td>算法逻辑</td>\n<td>寄存器划分、门级结构</td>\n<td>不一定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTL</td>\n<td>寄存器边界 + 组合逻辑</td>\n<td>具体用哪些标准单元</td>\n<td>是（主流）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门级</td>\n<td>每个门和连线</td>\n<td>几乎没有</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-rtl-是设计的主战场\">为什么 RTL 是设计的主战场</h2><p>RTL 之所以胜出，是因为它在两个相互冲突的目标间取得了平衡：足够抽象，让人能高效地表达上百万门的设计；又足够具体，让综合工具能确定性地把它映射成门级网表，并让时序分析有意义。行为级太抽象，工具无法可靠综合；门级太具体，人无法手工管理规模。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"verilog\" data-code=\"// 一个典型的 RTL 片段：累加器&#10;module accumulator(input clk, rst, input [7:0] din,&#10;                   output reg [15:0] acc);&#10;  always @(posedge clk) begin       // 时序：寄存器在时钟沿更新&#10;    if (rst) acc &lt;= 16&#39;d0;&#10;    else     acc &lt;= acc + din;      // 组合逻辑 acc+din 的结果被锁存&#10;  end&#10;endmodule\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 一个典型的 RTL 片段：累加器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module accumulator(input clk, rst, input [7:0] din,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                   output reg [15:0] acc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  always @(posedge clk) begin       // 时序：寄存器在时钟沿更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (rst) acc &#x3C;= 16'd0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else     acc &#x3C;= acc + din;      // 组合逻辑 acc+din 的结果被锁存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>endmodule</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段代码里，<code>acc</code> 是寄存器，<code>acc + din</code> 是组合逻辑，时钟沿是它们的分界线。这种「时序块包裹组合表达式」的结构，是 RTL 的标志性形态，也是<a href=\"../modeling/sequential-logic\">时序逻辑</a>一篇要深入的内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据通路与控制通路\">数据通路与控制通路</h2><p>复杂的 RTL 设计通常被拆成两部分：<strong>数据通路</strong>负责实际的运算与搬运（加法器、乘法器、寄存器堆、多路选择器），<strong>控制通路</strong>负责决定每个周期数据通路该做什么（通常是一个状态机）。把这两者分离，是工业级 RTL 设计的基本组织原则。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部分</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>典型构件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据通路</td>\n<td>算与存</td>\n<td>ALU、寄存器堆、MUX、移位器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制通路</td>\n<td>决策与时序</td>\n<td>有限状态机、计数器、译码器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>控制通路里那个状态机的写法，是<a href=\"../practice/fsm-design\">有限状态机设计</a>一篇的核心；数据通路里的多路选择和算术，则大量依赖<a href=\"../modeling/combinational-logic\">组合逻辑</a>的建模技巧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rtl-与时序约束\">RTL 与时序约束</h2><p>RTL 的「寄存器之间」这个结构，直接决定了电路能跑多快。两个寄存器之间的组合逻辑越深，信号传播延时越大，时钟周期就必须越长。一个寄存器到寄存器的路径要满足的基本约束是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{clk} \\ge t_{cq} + t_{logic} + t_{setup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{cq}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是寄存器从时钟沿到输出的延时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{logic}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是中间组合逻辑的延时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{setup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是下一级寄存器的建立时间。这个不等式是静态时序分析的基石，也解释了为什么综合后需要做时序检查。它与仿真中的时序概念既相关又不同，详见<a href=\"../verification/simulation-timing\">仿真与时序</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RTL 把电路抽象成「寄存器 + 寄存器之间的组合逻辑」，一个时钟周期就是一次「算出新值并在边沿锁存」的过程。</li>\n<li>RTL 站在行为级与门级之间，是可综合、可时序分析、又能管理大规模的最佳折中，因而成为主流设计层次。</li>\n<li>工业级设计常把 RTL 拆成数据通路（算与存）和控制通路（决策与时序）两部分分别组织。</li>\n<li>寄存器到寄存器路径的时序约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{clk} \\ge t_{cq} + t_{logic} + t_{setup}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把 RTL 结构与最高时钟频率直接联系起来。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RTL 抽象层次","id":"rtl-抽象层次"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么 RTL 是设计的主战场","id":"为什么-rtl-是设计的主战场"},{"level":2,"text":"数据通路与控制通路","id":"数据通路与控制通路"},{"level":2,"text":"RTL 与时序约束","id":"rtl-与时序约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"为什么需要硬件描述语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/foundations/why-hdl"},"next":{"title":"模块与端口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/verilog-hdl/foundations/modules-ports"}}